,"explanation":"감기：感冒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기가","audio":"/audio/d900d01cd84038266b50.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어지질","meaning":"好转，痊愈，改掉","explanation":"떨어지다：好转，痊愈，改掉；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"16","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어지질","audio":"/audio/192b2252a7d59ce902d1.mp3"}},{"text":"않네.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않네","audio":"/audio/b40e55f0ebdbecd446e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"d0ec39bb748c4998","term":"좀처럼","zh":"不容易，轻易地","audio":"/audio/d0ec39bb748c4998f704.mp3","entryId":"76380","definition":"一般般地，或还算过得去地。","pronunciation":["좀ː처럼"]},{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"好转，痊愈，改掉","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"病好转或改了老毛病。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d71f692150016559ee4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76380","label":"国立